  Description: Creates an autonomous projectile attacker. The main tower attack is replaced and the ballista has limited range/durability. Supported Attack Skills cannot be used with Melee Weapons Supported Skills will summon a Ballista Totem which uses that Skill Totem lasts # seconds Supported Skills have # to maximum number of Summoned Ballista Totems Supported Skills have #% less Attack Speed
